# Deny-by-default: nothing enters the build context unless allow-listed below.
# This guarantees .env, bin/, and .git can never leak into an image layer.
*

# --- build inputs (add new top-level source dirs here) ---
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/

# Re-exclude junk that could live inside the allow-listed dirs.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
